> ely. therefore 

                      |  [de] Religion wichtig fr Wohlbefinden und
                      |   Zufriedenheit (M1, M3-M5) [2013, 2017-
          Survey Year | [1] [de]   [2] [de]   [3] [de]   [4] [de]  |     Total
----------------------+--------------------------------------------+----------
                 2013 |     1,253      1,629      1,112        709 |     4,703 
                 2017 |     1,420      1,277        531        449 |     3,677 
