. 
.         *Impute religiosity from 2016 all samples (plh0343_v2) and from m1-m3
>  for  2013, 2017, 2018, 2019 (plh0343_v1) 
. 
.         *2016 all samples (plh0343_v2 )
.         cap drop religiosity*

.         gen religiosity_2016_h =  plh0343_v2 if syear == 2016
(550,751 missing values generated)

.         
.         *m1-m3 for  2013, 2017, 2018, 2019 (plh0343_v1) 
.         gen religiosity_2013_h =  plh0343_v1 if syear == 2013 & inlist(psampl
> e, 15, 17, 18, 19) 
(569,141 missing values generated)

.         gen religiosity_2017_h =  plh0343_v1 if syear == 2017 & inlist(psampl
> e, 15, 17, 18, 19) 
(570,167 missing values generated)

.         gen religiosity_2018_h =  plh0343_v1 if syear == 2018 & inlist(psampl
> e, 15, 17, 18, 19) 
(573,491 missing values generated)

.         gen religiosity_2019_h =  plh0343_v1 if syear == 2019 & inlist(psampl
> e, 15, 17, 18, 19) 
(570,744 missing values generated)

.         
.         cap drop religiosity_h

.         bysort pid: egen religiosity_h = max(religiosity_2016_h) if !missing(
> religiosity_2016_h)
(550,751 missing values generated)

